## Cute Halloween Is Just as Valid as Scary

<strong>Cute Halloween nails</strong> are not a compromise version of the holiday, they are their own complete aesthetic with a design logic all their own: soft palettes, rounded shapes, friendly faces, and restraint where a scarier look would pile on more. You do not owe anyone blood and skulls to prove you are participating in spooky season.

Screenshot the two or three ideas from this post that pulled at you most, whether that is the milky white ghost set, the negative space pumpkin, or the simplest dotting-tool version built for a first attempt. Bring them to your nail tech or try them yourself with nothing more than a dotting tool and a steady hand. Either way, this is Halloween on your terms, and it never needed to be scary to count.
